      "transliteration": "saraba(n) mukataa ||144||",
      "translation": "Thou art free from all! 144",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਸਾਰਿਆਂ ਤੋਂ ਮੁਕਤ ਹੈਂ ॥੧੪੪॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सरबं मुकता ॥१४४॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74791",
      "sourceShabadId": "7416",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0030",
      "lineIndex": 30,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰਸਾਵਲ ਛੰਦ ॥ ਤ੍ਵ ਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ ॥",
      "transliteration": "rasaaval chha(n)dh || tavai prasaadh ||",
      "translation": "RASAAVAL STANZA. BY THY GRACE",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਰਸਾਵਲ ਛੰਦ: ਤੇਰੀ ਕ੍ਰਿਪਾ ਨਾਲ:",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रसावल छंद ॥ त्व प्रसादि ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74792",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0031",
      "lineIndex": 31,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਨਰਕ ਨਾਸੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namo narak naase ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Destroyer of Hell Lord",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਨਰਕਾ ਨੂੰ ਨਸ਼ਟ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ!",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो नरक नासे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74793",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0032",
      "lineIndex": 32,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਦੈਵੰ ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sadhaiva(n) prakaase ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Ever-Illumined Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸਦਾ ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ਿਤ ਰਹਿਣ ਵਾਲੇ!",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सदैवं प्रकासे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74794",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0033",
      "lineIndex": 33,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਨੰਗੰ ਸਰੂਪੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ana(n)ga(n) saroope ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Bodyless Entity Lord",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸ਼ਰੀਰਰਹਿਤ ਰੂਪ ਵਾਲੇ!",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अनंगं सरूपे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74795",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0034",
      "lineIndex": 34,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਭੰਗੰ ਬਿਭੂਤੇ ॥੧੪੫॥",
      "transliteration": "abha(n)ga(n) bibhoote ||145||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Eternal and Effulgent Lord ! 145",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਨਸ਼ਟ ਨਾ ਹੋਣ ਵਾਲੀ ਸੰਪੱਤੀ ਵਾਲੇ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੧੪੫॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अभंगं बिभूते ॥१४५॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74796",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0035",
      "lineIndex": 35,
      "gurmukhi": "ਪ੍ਰਮਾਥੰ ਪ੍ਰਮਾਥੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "pramaatha(n) pramaathe ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Destroyer of Tyrants Lord",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਦੁਖ ਦੇਣ ਵਾਲਿਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਨਸ਼ਟ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ!",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "प्रमाथं प्रमाथे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74797",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0036",
      "lineIndex": 36,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਦਾ ਸਰਬ ਸਾਥੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sadhaa sarab saathe ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Companion of all Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸਦਾ ਸਭ ਦੇ ਮੱਦਦਗਾਰ ਹੋਣ ਵਾਲੇ!",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सदा सरब साथे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74798",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0037",
      "lineIndex": 37,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਗਾਧ ਸਰੂਪੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "agaadh saroope ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Impenetrable Entity Lord",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸਦਾ ਅਗਾਧ ਸਰੂਪ ਵਾਲੇ!",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अगाध सरूपे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74799",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0038",
      "lineIndex": 38,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨ੍ਰਿਬਾਧ ਬਿਭੂਤੇ ॥੧੪੬॥",
      "transliteration": "nirabaadh bibhoote ||146||",
      "translation": "Salution to Thee O Non-annoying Glorious Lord ! 146",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਨਿਰਵਿਘਨ ਸੰਪੱਤੀ ਵਾਲੇ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ) ॥੧੪੬॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नृबाध बिभूते ॥१४६॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74800",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0039",
      "lineIndex": 39,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਨੰਗੀ ਅਨਾਮੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ana(n)gee anaame ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Limbless and Nameless LordA",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਅੰਗ (ਸ਼ਰੀਰ) ਅਤੇ ਨਾਮ ਤੋਂ ਰਹਿਤ!",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अनंगी अनामे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74801",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0040",
      "lineIndex": 40,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤ੍ਰਿਭੰਗੀ ਤ੍ਰਿਕਾਮੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "tirabha(n)gee tirakaame ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Destroyer and Restorer of three modes Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਤਿੰਨਾ ਲੋਕਾ ਨੂੰ ਨਸ਼ਟ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ ਅਤੇ ਤਿੰਨਾ ਦੀਆਂ ਕਾਮਨਾਵਾ ਪੂਰੀਆਂ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ!",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तृभंगी तृकामे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74802",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0041",
      "lineIndex": 41,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨ੍ਰਿਭੰਗੀ ਸਰੂਪੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "nirabha(n)gee saroope ||",
      "translation": "Salutation tho Thee O Eternal Enity Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਅਵਿਨਾਸ਼ੀ ਸਰੂਪ ਵਾਲੇ!",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नृभंगी सरूपे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74803",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0042",
      "lineIndex": 42,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਰਬੰਗੀ ਅਨੂਪੇ ॥੧੪੭॥",
      "transliteration": "saraba(n)gee anoope ||147||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Unique in all respects Lord 147",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸਾਰਿਆਂ ਦੇ ਸਾਥੀ ਅਤੇ ਉਪਮਾ ਤੋਂ ਰਹਿਤ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ) ॥੧੪੭॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सरबंगी अनूपे ॥१४७॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74804",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0043",
      "lineIndex": 43,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨ ਪੋਤ੍ਰੈ ਨ ਪੁਤ੍ਰੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "n potrai na putrai ||",
      "translation": "O Lord !  Thou art Sonless and Grandsonless. O Lord !",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਹੇ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ!) ਤੇਰਾ ਨਾ ਕੋਈ ਪੁੱਤਰ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਨਾ ਹੀ ਪੋਤਰਾ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "न पोत्रै न पुत्रै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74805",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0044",
      "lineIndex": 44,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨ ਸੱਤ੍ਰੈ ਨ ਮਿਤ੍ਰੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "n sa'trai na mitrai ||",
      "translation": "Thou art Enemyless and Friendless.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਨਾ ਕੋਈ ਵੈਰੀ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਨਾ ਹੀ ਕੋਈ ਮਿਤਰ ਹੈ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "न सत्त्रै न मित्रै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74806",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0045",
      "lineIndex": 45,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨ ਤਾਤੈ ਨ ਮਾਤੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "n taatai na maatai ||",
      "translation": "O Lord !  Thou art Fatherless and Motherless. O Lord !",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਨਾ ਤੇਰਾ ਕੋਈ ਪਿਤਾ ਹੈ ਨਾ ਮਾਤਾ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "न तातै न मातै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74807",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0046",
      "lineIndex": 46,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨ ਜਾਤੈ ਨ ਪਾਤੈ ॥੧੪੮॥",
      "transliteration": "n jaatai na paatai ||148||",
      "translation": "Thou art Casteless. And Lineagless. 148.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਨਾ ਤੇਰੀ ਕੋਈ ਜਾਤਿ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਨਾ ਹੀ ਭਾਈਚਾਰਾ ॥੧੪੮॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "न जातै न पातै ॥१४८॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74808",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0047",
      "lineIndex": 47,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨ੍ਰਿਸਾਕੰ ਸਰੀਕ ਹੈਂ ॥",
      "transliteration": "nirasaaka(n) sareek hai(n) ||",
      "translation": "O Lord !  Thou art Relativeless. O Lord !",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਹੇ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ!) ਤੇਰਾ ਨਾ ਤਾ ਕੋਈ ਸਾਕ ਹੈ, ਨਾ ਹੀ ਸ਼ਰੀਕ ਹੈ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नृसाकं सरीक हैं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74809",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0048",
      "lineIndex": 48,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਮਿਤੋ ਅਮੀਕ ਹੈਂ ॥",
      "transliteration": "amito ameek hai(n) ||",
      "translation": "Thou art Limitless and Profound.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤੂੰ ਅਮਿਤ ਅਤੇ ਅਪਾਰ ਹੈਂ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अमितो अमीक हैं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74810",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0049",
      "lineIndex": 49,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਦੈਵੰ ਪ੍ਰਭਾ ਹੈਂ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sadhaiva(n) prabhaa hai(n) ||",
      "translation": "O Lord !  Thou art Ever Glorious. O Lord !",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤੂੰ ਸਦਾ ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ਮਾਨ ਹੈਂ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सदैवं प्रभा हैं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74811",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0050",
      "lineIndex": 50,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਜੈ ਹੈਂ ਅਜਾ ਹੈਂ ॥੧੪੯॥",
      "transliteration": "ajai hai(n) ajaa hai(n) ||149||",
      "translation": "Thou art Unconquerable and Unborn. 149.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤੂੰ ਅਜਿਤ ਅਤੇ ਅਜਨਮਾ ਹੈਂ ॥੧੪੯॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अजै हैं अजा हैं ॥१४९॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74812",
      "sourceShabadId": "7417",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0051",
      "lineIndex": 51,
      "gurmukhi": "ਭਗਵਤੀ ਛੰਦ ॥ ਤ੍ਵ ਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bhagavatee chha(n)dh || tavai prasaadh ||",
      "translation": "BHAGVATI STANZA. BY THY GRACE",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਭਗਵਤੀ ਛੰਦ: ਤੇਰੀ ਕ੍ਰਿਪਾ ਨਾਲ:",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "भगवती छंद ॥ त्व प्रसादि ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74813",
      "sourceShabadId": "7418",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0052",
      "lineIndex": 52,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਿ ਜ਼ਾਹਰ ਜ਼ਹੂਰ ਹੈਂ ॥",
      "transliteration": "k zaahar zahoor hai(n) ||",
      "translation": "That Thou art visible illumination!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਹੇ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ!) ਤੂੰ ਪ੍ਰਗਟ ਰੂਪ ਵਿਚ ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ਮਾਨ ਹੈਂ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कि ज़ाहर ज़हूर हैं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74814",
      "sourceShabadId": "7418",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0053",
      "lineIndex": 53,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਿ ਹਾਜ਼ਰ ਹਜ਼ੂਰ ਹੈਂ ॥",
      "transliteration": "k haazar hazoor hai(n) ||",
      "translation": "That Thou art All-Prevading!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤੂੰ ਸਾਹਮਣੇ ਮੌਜੂਦ ਹੈਂ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कि हाज़र हज़ूर हैं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74815",
      "sourceShabadId": "7418",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0054",
      "lineIndex": 54,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹਮੇਸੁਲ ਸਲਾਮ ਹੈਂ ॥",
      "transliteration": "hamesul salaam hai(n) ||",
      "translation": "That Thou art reveiver of Eternal conpliments!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤੂੰ ਹਮੇਸ਼ਾ ਸਲਾਮਤ ਹੈਂ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 8,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "हमेसुल सलाम हैं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74816",
      "sourceShabadId": "7418",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0008_line_0055",
      "lineIndex": 55,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਮਸਤੁਲ ਕਲਾਮ ਹੈਂ ॥੧੫੦॥",
